# ai-copilots (library operator harness)

When creating or migrating a library's agent harness, editing `AGENTS.md` /
`ai-copilots/**`, or wiring a Go dependency's skills into a host IDE:

- If `AGENTS.md` or `ai-copilots/` is missing, load `.cursor/skills/ai-readiness/SKILL.md`
  first (and `.cursor/personas/ai-readiness.persona.md` when a setup fork exists).
- Load `.cursor/skills/author-ai-copilots/SKILL.md` (templates in `reference.md`).
- Load `.cursor/skills/agent-smith/SKILL.md` when authoring or reviewing skill bodies.
- If editing pack-owned files under `.cursor/packs/shared/`, follow `.cursor/skills/edit-cursor-packs/SKILL.md`.

Resolve module Dir with `go list -m -f '{{.Dir}}' <module-path>` before host symlinks.
Prefer symlink/junction to in-module `ai-copilots/`; do not copy skill bodies without approval.
